WEBVTT

00:00:00.054 --> 00:00:06.396
Excitement at the end
of the summer.

00:00:17.166 --> 00:00:22.945
After spending three months in beautiful Scottish
countryside, the end of vacation is almost here.

00:00:23.364 --> 00:00:28.012
There is only one week left
before everybody leaves Summer school.

00:01:02.271 --> 00:01:05.115
I'm not good at writing... though there's
so much I'd like to write about.

00:01:05.881 --> 00:01:09.236
It's impossible to write about three months'
worth of events in only one week, right?

00:01:11.784 --> 00:01:15.106
Patty? How come you're doing so well?

00:01:15.382 --> 00:01:18.189
There's only one thing I'd like to write about.

00:01:18.452 --> 00:01:21.838
Only one? During all this time?

00:01:21.839 --> 00:01:24.771
Yes. I only want to write about how
I met a wonderful friend.

00:01:25.150 --> 00:01:26.497
A friend?

00:01:26.983 --> 00:01:27.945
Alistea...

00:01:29.176 --> 00:01:30.781
Don't look!

00:01:32.055 --> 00:01:33.323
Sorry, sorry!

00:01:33.504 --> 00:01:36.016
But I'm glad that Annie found someone, as well.

00:01:36.178 --> 00:01:37.580
Candy, you have someone, too?

00:01:37.882 --> 00:01:38.814
Me?

00:01:38.852 --> 00:01:39.825
Terry.

00:01:40.332 --> 00:01:42.345
You've got to be kidding me, that punk!

00:01:42.864 --> 00:01:44.976
You really think that he's a punk?

00:01:45.309 --> 00:01:47.417
Patty, you're all serious!

00:01:47.452 --> 00:01:48.528
Candy!

00:01:48.888 --> 00:01:49.884
Candy!

00:01:50.280 --> 00:01:52.359
-It's an emergency!
-What's the matter?

00:01:52.509 --> 00:01:53.770
Archie will die!

00:01:53.805 --> 00:01:54.855
Archie?

00:01:55.035 --> 00:01:56.555
Terry is going to kill him!

00:01:56.783 --> 00:01:59.470
What do you mean; Terry is going to kill him?

00:01:59.505 --> 00:02:01.118
They are duelling!

00:02:01.361 --> 00:02:02.439
Duelling?

00:02:12.900 --> 00:02:17.172
Hey, Archie! Why don't you
call it a draw? Okay? Archie?

00:02:17.771 --> 00:02:22.659
Bro, pipe down!
I'm going to show this cheeky bastard!

00:02:23.854 --> 00:02:25.722
You're only big on your words, boy.

00:02:25.880 --> 00:02:29.510
Shut up! I'm going to close that
rude mouth of yours once for all!

00:02:35.552 --> 00:02:37.733
-Terry!
-Stop, Archie!

00:02:45.169 --> 00:02:47.763
Stop this stupidity, both of you!

00:02:47.860 --> 00:02:50.232
-It's dangerous, don't get close!
-You stay away!

00:02:50.630 --> 00:02:52.041
They're serious.

00:02:52.252 --> 00:02:54.245
Stear, how come this happened?

00:02:54.815 --> 00:02:57.094
They wanted to fight each other
for a long time now.

00:02:57.651 --> 00:02:58.978
Stear, what is this?

00:02:59.013 --> 00:03:00.919
It's a safety armor; my invention!

00:03:00.954 --> 00:03:04.502
If something happened to Archie,
I would fight Terry instead!

00:03:04.687 --> 00:03:05.812
Stear!

00:03:06.404 --> 00:03:08.600
Candy, please, make them stop!

00:03:08.797 --> 00:03:10.181
It's okay, Annie!

00:03:11.787 --> 00:03:13.647
Both of you, hold it!

00:03:15.293 --> 00:03:16.178
Candy!

00:03:16.213 --> 00:03:19.043
What do you think, Patty, isn't it silly
that we are the only spectators,

00:03:19.213 --> 00:03:21.488
...so why don't we invite more spectators
from the village?

00:03:21.888 --> 00:03:22.974
Hey, Candy!

00:03:29.426 --> 00:03:30.496
Stear!

00:03:31.142 --> 00:03:33.200
Come! I'm ready!

00:03:33.369 --> 00:03:34.880
You've got some guts.

00:03:49.513 --> 00:03:50.932
Annie, get a hold of yourself!

00:03:58.592 --> 00:04:00.928
Let's call it a draw.

00:04:13.643 --> 00:04:16.509
-Annie, pull yourself together!
-Stear! Stear!

00:04:17.291 --> 00:04:19.514
-I'm glad.
-Yeah, I'm glad too.

00:04:40.207 --> 00:04:43.182
I would've died if Archie got killed.

00:04:43.791 --> 00:04:46.942
Why do men do such horrible things?

00:04:47.731 --> 00:04:51.023
Candy, isn't there a way to make them get along?

00:04:51.291 --> 00:04:55.356
Hardly! They didn't fight because one was
clearly wrong and the other was right.

00:04:55.515 --> 00:04:58.377
In all, they just couldn't stand each other, right?

00:04:58.558 --> 00:05:00.328
And that's why they duelled?

00:05:00.573 --> 00:05:01.728
Probably!

00:05:02.177 --> 00:05:03.363
Horrible!

00:05:03.853 --> 00:05:09.064
Neither Terry or Archie are in Summer school.
We can't keep our eyes peeled on them...

00:05:09.260 --> 00:05:11.644
Candy, please ask Terry!

00:05:11.723 --> 00:05:12.541
What?

00:05:12.576 --> 00:05:14.376
To stay away from Archie.

00:05:15.475 --> 00:05:18.284
Yes. I'll ask him first thing
in the morning...

00:05:29.790 --> 00:05:31.401
Hello, Terry!

00:05:31.462 --> 00:05:33.287
Terry is in the hangar!

00:05:33.827 --> 00:05:35.248
Where is it?

00:05:35.555 --> 00:05:36.838
That way.

00:05:46.667 --> 00:05:47.764
An airplane!

00:05:56.484 --> 00:05:57.752
Can I help you?

00:05:57.753 --> 00:05:59.072
Terry...

00:05:59.277 --> 00:06:01.646
-What kind of airplane is this?
-It's my dad's toy.

00:06:02.204 --> 00:06:04.892
But it's become broken-down and useless.

00:06:05.280 --> 00:06:07.458
That's it! I'll use this airplane.

00:06:08.772 --> 00:06:11.766
Say, Terry... would you like to have
this airplane repaired?

00:06:11.865 --> 00:06:14.017
I'm fine with that, but who would ride it?

00:06:14.184 --> 00:06:15.307
I'll stop by later!

00:06:16.074 --> 00:06:17.114
Bye!

00:06:17.149 --> 00:06:19.935
Hey, Candy!
What's up with her?

00:06:21.289 --> 00:06:25.715
What? A broken airplane?
It must be Fleet model 17!

00:06:27.997 --> 00:06:30.359
Stear, you like cars and airplanes?

00:06:30.394 --> 00:06:33.637
I love them! Candy, take me to that place!

00:06:34.039 --> 00:06:34.952
Alright!

00:06:35.144 --> 00:06:37.411
Brother, you'll go to his place?

00:06:37.584 --> 00:06:40.733
I might turn my dream of flying
through the skies into reality!

00:06:40.888 --> 00:06:42.366
-Well, Archie?
-No!

00:06:42.727 --> 00:06:44.916
-Let's go anyway...
-I won't!

00:06:44.951 --> 00:06:45.750
Hurry!

00:06:45.908 --> 00:06:50.980
-Candy, if those two meet again...
-It's safer for them to meet when we are around.

00:06:50.981 --> 00:06:52.151
-Hurry up, now!
-Come on!

00:06:52.323 --> 00:06:56.887
-Why are you so slow?
-No! I don't want to see that guy!

00:06:57.061 --> 00:07:01.011
Come on! He even has a Fleet model 17!
Does it matter if you're a bit mad at him?

00:07:01.195 --> 00:07:04.254
But even you said that you didn't
want to have anything with that guy!

00:07:04.289 --> 00:07:06.413
But it's a whole different story
now that I know of that airplane...

00:07:06.619 --> 00:07:08.568
Hurry, this way!

00:07:08.922 --> 00:07:13.308
Come on! See, Candy is calling us.
Hey!

00:07:13.851 --> 00:07:15.525
Hurry, hurry!

00:07:15.861 --> 00:07:18.492
It'll be the first time Terry will
spend time with all of us.

00:07:18.892 --> 00:07:20.918
Will Terry give up his stubbornness?

00:07:26.833 --> 00:07:29.747
-What a wonderful mansion!
-I didn't expect anything less!

00:07:30.159 --> 00:07:31.751
Where are Stear and Archie?

00:07:33.849 --> 00:07:36.062
-Come...!
-No! I'm going back!

00:07:36.227 --> 00:07:40.132
Archie, if you go back now, it will
look as if you got afraid of him.

00:07:42.602 --> 00:07:43.685
Terry!

00:07:44.356 --> 00:07:45.823
TERRY!!!

00:07:48.546 --> 00:07:51.975
Thank you! I thought my heart was going
to split when I heard about this!

00:07:52.679 --> 00:07:53.842
Incredible!

00:07:57.076 --> 00:07:59.915
This really is Fleet model 17!

00:08:01.474 --> 00:08:04.349
Patty, won't you pinch me?

00:08:04.384 --> 00:08:06.274
I don't want to do such a bad thing...

00:08:06.587 --> 00:08:08.868
-I'll pinch you!
-Ow!

00:08:08.912 --> 00:08:10.228
It's not a dream! It's really true!

00:08:10.263 --> 00:08:14.771
Mr. Terry! Hear the sound of my pounding heart!
I'm completely indebted to you!

00:08:14.940 --> 00:08:18.797
I see you in a whole different light now!
Thank you for letting me repair such a treasure!

00:08:19.235 --> 00:08:20.946
It's my pleasure...

00:08:21.130 --> 00:08:23.748
Let's get down to work!
Archie, help me out here.

00:08:24.271 --> 00:08:25.289
Brother!

00:08:26.982 --> 00:08:29.757
I'll do all I can to make it fly
while we're still here in Scotland!

00:08:30.969 --> 00:08:33.236
-What a grimy place.
-Archie...!

00:08:33.326 --> 00:08:37.067
Oh? American hangars have carpeted floors?

00:08:37.444 --> 00:08:38.745
What was that?

00:08:38.927 --> 00:08:40.020
Archie!

00:08:40.128 --> 00:08:43.485
...no, mr. Terry, as you can see, the manners
of my little brother leave something to be desired...

00:08:43.645 --> 00:08:46.044
...so when he acts up, just try to laugh it off!

00:08:46.956 --> 00:08:47.895
Now, hurry...

00:08:48.214 --> 00:08:48.863
Brother!

00:08:48.864 --> 00:08:51.495
It's going well with Archie and Terry.

00:08:52.105 --> 00:08:53.559
Candy, I'd like to have a word with you.

00:09:01.663 --> 00:09:03.084
What is it?

00:09:03.246 --> 00:09:05.737
For how long have you been studying drama?

00:09:05.908 --> 00:09:06.787
What do you mean?

00:09:06.950 --> 00:09:08.801
I'm saying that you'd better not try
to pull some strange tricks on me.

00:09:08.950 --> 00:09:09.900
You knew?

00:09:10.456 --> 00:09:13.492
I can easily see through women's tricks
and where they are going.

00:09:13.625 --> 00:09:15.495
Terry, I'm not pulling tricks...

00:09:25.018 --> 00:09:28.286
Finally, this is the last day of Summer school.

00:09:28.651 --> 00:09:32.415
Meaningfully spend your last day in Scotland.

00:09:33.138 --> 00:09:34.985
-Candice! Annie!
-Yes!

00:09:35.020 --> 00:09:36.605
What is it? What are you doing?

00:09:36.783 --> 00:09:40.579
Free time... no, I mean, we're talking
about studying...

00:09:40.580 --> 00:09:43.540
You'll spend your free time inside!

00:09:44.136 --> 00:09:45.387
-Teacher!
-Teacher!

00:09:53.395 --> 00:09:56.791
Say, Candy... do you think that Archie
and Terry are fighting again now?

00:09:57.229 --> 00:10:01.523
You don't have to worry while Stear is with them!
Patty will be back soon.

00:10:02.327 --> 00:10:03.880
It's probably nothing but...

00:10:11.588 --> 00:10:13.155
Patty! How did it go?

00:10:16.115 --> 00:10:17.673
So they duelled again?

00:10:17.717 --> 00:10:20.789
When I went to the mansion, I ran into Eliza...

00:10:20.826 --> 00:10:21.943
Eliza?

00:10:24.307 --> 00:10:25.631
Go back.

00:10:25.895 --> 00:10:26.746
Why?

00:10:26.910 --> 00:10:32.382
Tell Candy that she'd better remember
that I am the one whom Terry likes.

00:10:35.161 --> 00:10:38.536
Eliza thinks that Terry likes her?
That's a good one!

00:10:38.641 --> 00:10:40.732
But you don't know what Terry thinks.

00:10:40.886 --> 00:10:43.385
Say, you don't know what's going on
with Archie and others?

00:10:43.458 --> 00:10:47.002
It looked though Archie and Stear will stay there
repairing that airplane overnight.

00:10:47.091 --> 00:10:48.453
Overnight?

00:10:49.078 --> 00:10:52.169
He's trying to make that plane airworthy
while we are still in Scotland.

00:10:52.977 --> 00:10:55.643
*Denjin Anime Fansub*
Okay, now I'm, like, really tired.

00:10:57.209 --> 00:10:59.783
Archie, take off that lever...

00:11:00.131 --> 00:11:02.168
We need to complete the overhaul till dawn.

00:11:02.660 --> 00:11:04.274
We'll pull yet another all-nighter?

00:11:04.992 --> 00:11:07.915
Don't complain, one more night won't hurt you.

00:11:08.335 --> 00:11:09.686
Brother, I'm tired of this!

00:11:09.839 --> 00:11:11.775
You were all over that guy with your compliments!

00:11:11.839 --> 00:11:14.844
Archie, do I look like the kind of man
who'd flatter other people?

00:11:14.855 --> 00:11:16.443
But you were fawning over Terry!

00:11:16.613 --> 00:11:19.347
I was just sincerely thanking him.

00:11:19.699 --> 00:11:21.525
Why would you want to thank that guy?

00:11:24.281 --> 00:11:27.246
A real man doesn't sneak around
badmouthing other people.

00:11:29.169 --> 00:11:32.007
Don't tell me that a real man
would be eavesdropping then?

00:11:32.042 --> 00:11:33.377
Alright! Come get some!

00:11:33.560 --> 00:11:34.877
Stop that, Archie!

00:11:34.972 --> 00:11:38.271
Mr. Terry, my little brother is quick
to pick a fight... please, forgive him.

00:11:38.411 --> 00:11:41.347
-Brother! I'm not going to put up with him anymore!
-Same here!

00:12:07.004 --> 00:12:09.034
You're pretty good, boy.

00:12:09.203 --> 00:12:10.942
You too, Terry!

00:12:14.712 --> 00:12:16.591
Stop that! The precious airplane will...

00:12:23.751 --> 00:12:25.109
Look out, Archie!

00:12:32.509 --> 00:12:33.628
Terry?

00:12:34.292 --> 00:12:37.019
If you got killed, I would have lost
my fighting companion.

00:12:37.396 --> 00:12:38.395
Terry?

00:12:45.359 --> 00:12:47.871
Today's lecture is over.

00:12:53.082 --> 00:12:56.441
Annie, Patty, it's finally time to
put our plan into action.

00:12:56.469 --> 00:12:57.474
Tonight?

00:12:57.509 --> 00:12:58.865
If somebody sees us...

00:12:59.023 --> 00:13:04.678
They can't punish us, because we'll be
leaving Scotland by tomorrow morning.

00:13:05.461 --> 00:13:06.369
That's right.

00:13:09.314 --> 00:13:10.229
Huh?

00:13:35.825 --> 00:13:40.495
-I've never pushed such a cart before!
-Good thing that we have this moonlight...

00:13:44.374 --> 00:13:47.688
I'm sure I'll never forget this night!

00:13:47.941 --> 00:13:51.582
-But still, we look like thieves!
-Aww, Candy!

00:13:56.983 --> 00:13:59.229
Brother, give up!

00:13:59.412 --> 00:14:01.874
My stamina is gone after working
all night long...

00:14:03.534 --> 00:14:04.577
Mr. Terry.

00:14:04.846 --> 00:14:09.006
Could you please excuse my brother today?
He's too tired to fight you.

00:14:10.063 --> 00:14:12.286
So now my enemy is than engine over there?

00:14:13.206 --> 00:14:14.342
Mr. Terry.

00:14:15.144 --> 00:14:17.293
You want to get it flying by tomorrow morning?

00:14:17.850 --> 00:14:19.850
Thank you.
Archie!

00:14:20.555 --> 00:14:22.746
One, two, three...

00:14:36.103 --> 00:14:38.061
Say, it turned out like this...

00:14:39.044 --> 00:14:41.353
It's better that way!

00:14:41.817 --> 00:14:44.232
I've never cooked before...

00:14:47.259 --> 00:14:49.217
Annie, soup!

00:14:50.380 --> 00:14:51.478
Oh, no!

00:14:55.083 --> 00:14:56.969
Now, engine test!

00:15:03.236 --> 00:15:05.049
Strange.
Now!

00:15:08.448 --> 00:15:09.531
It's running!

00:15:16.288 --> 00:15:17.488
Candy!

00:15:19.580 --> 00:15:21.065
Congratulations, Stear!

00:15:21.169 --> 00:15:23.482
The meal is ready!

00:15:28.194 --> 00:15:29.307
Great!

00:15:33.972 --> 00:15:35.050
I like this.

00:15:37.762 --> 00:15:38.932
What's this?

00:15:39.009 --> 00:15:40.140
I'm sorry!

00:15:45.329 --> 00:15:46.806
Look, the dawn.

00:15:49.876 --> 00:15:52.026
Now, it's a new day, let's do some miracles!

00:16:10.936 --> 00:16:14.244
One - two! One - two! One - two!
Do your best, everybody!

00:16:14.898 --> 00:16:16.397
Candy, what are you doing?

00:16:16.560 --> 00:16:20.035
I'm giving you the tempo!
One - two! One - two!

00:16:20.605 --> 00:16:22.840
But you only move your mouth, right?

00:16:22.928 --> 00:16:25.108
That's right! Oh, no!

00:16:36.770 --> 00:16:38.123
This direction is good.

00:16:38.443 --> 00:16:39.980
Now, let's fly!

00:16:40.921 --> 00:16:43.135
-Stear, will you be okay?
-Sure thing!

00:16:43.552 --> 00:16:45.498
I'll just give it a spin through the air.

00:16:45.818 --> 00:16:47.352
Brother, let's go!

00:16:47.956 --> 00:16:49.257
Alright! Archie, do it!

00:16:49.420 --> 00:16:51.912
Okay! One, two, three...

00:16:55.648 --> 00:16:58.635
Stear, don't do anything unreasonable!
Don't get hurt, okay?

00:16:58.806 --> 00:17:00.039
Now, let's fly!

00:17:18.184 --> 00:17:19.141
He did it!

00:17:19.463 --> 00:17:21.504
Stear's airplane is really flying!

00:17:21.539 --> 00:17:22.795
It's flying!

00:17:26.401 --> 00:17:27.462
I lose.

00:17:29.604 --> 00:17:31.789
I didn't think it would've flown.

00:17:31.971 --> 00:17:33.217
Hey!

00:17:39.470 --> 00:17:41.644
Hey, I'm flying!

00:17:47.371 --> 00:17:49.328
Hey!

00:17:54.837 --> 00:17:56.932
Hey!
...eh?

00:18:15.477 --> 00:18:16.541
Stear!

00:18:17.138 --> 00:18:18.900
-Stear!
-I'm okay.

00:18:19.307 --> 00:18:20.412
Stear!

00:18:21.191 --> 00:18:22.952
Well? I'm pretty sure it was flying...

00:18:22.987 --> 00:18:25.316
Yeah, it was flying! Right through the air!

00:18:47.826 --> 00:18:51.880
That airplane wound up like my father's youth.

00:18:52.040 --> 00:18:53.235
Your father's...?

00:18:53.838 --> 00:18:58.622
Back in the days while he was flying that airplane,
my father fell in love with a woman from America.

00:18:58.623 --> 00:18:59.554
And thus I was born.

00:19:00.795 --> 00:19:02.722
And then, he gave up the skies.

00:19:02.886 --> 00:19:05.335
He didn't marry my real mother.

00:19:05.370 --> 00:19:06.923
Why was that?

00:19:07.884 --> 00:19:10.364
He didn't want to ruin his noble bloodline.

00:19:10.770 --> 00:19:13.200
I didn't want to follow my father's way of life.

00:19:13.801 --> 00:19:16.176
I always wanted to be honest to myself.

00:19:16.848 --> 00:19:18.530
Terry is not a punk.

00:19:19.021 --> 00:19:21.873
He just wanted to be true to himself.

00:19:22.378 --> 00:19:24.703
-Candy, let's dance.
-Terry?

00:19:24.896 --> 00:19:26.474
To remember Scotland.

00:19:43.808 --> 00:19:45.997
Why did you stop so suddenly...?

00:19:51.052 --> 00:19:52.298
Terry...

00:20:31.772 --> 00:20:32.969
You punk!

00:20:34.493 --> 00:20:38.931
You're horrible! You're a punk, after all!
A playboy!

00:20:44.655 --> 00:20:48.190
Now I'm a playboy? A punk?
How can you say that?

00:20:48.570 --> 00:20:50.152
You're a punk because you are one!

00:20:51.827 --> 00:20:54.568
I was just being honest to myself.

00:20:54.785 --> 00:20:59.137
You're horrible... rude... I hate you...
Terry, I hate you!

00:21:00.660 --> 00:21:08.155
One after another, tears filled Candy's gaze
until she could see no more.

00:21:09.020 --> 00:21:18.151
And the wind which fluttered Terry's hair
somehow felt cold; autumn was drawing near.

00:21:18.386 --> 00:21:19.523
To be continued...
